'''Ultimate Spidermonkey''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of an [[Arachnachimp (Classic)|Arachnachimp]].

==Appearance==
===Ben as Ultimate Spidermonkey===
Ultimate Spidermonkey has a large gorilla-like body with purple skin, black fur and three pairs of eyes. He lacks [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]]'s tail and extra pair of arms, but they are replaced with two pairs of retractable spider legs that can fold into his waist. Ultimate Spidermonkey wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

===Albedo as Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Ultimate Spidermonkey has red eyes, pale-purple skin, and yellow spider fangs on each side of his mouth. Instead of the purple spider legs, Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey has two extra sets of gorilla arms, and he wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol, which has eight spikes now instead of four, on his stomach.
