TMoV (172).png|Web Cushion
Fame (472).png|Retractable Spider Legs ('''Ultimate Alien''' only)
TP (508).png|Sharp Spider Legs ('''Ultimate Alien''' only)
</gallery>
By splitting his lower jaw into two halves, Ultimate Spidermonkey can shoot webs from his mouth, much more than [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]] can shoot from his tail. His webs are strong enough to keep a [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]],<ref>''[[Double or Nothing]]''</ref> an [[Orishan]],<ref>''[[Fame]]''</ref> and a [[Gimlinopithecus]] from escaping.<ref>''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref> His webbing is also waterproof.{{Refn|''Ben 10 2013 Annual''; [[:File:UltimateSpidermonkey Annual.png|file]]|group = annual}}

Ultimate Spidermonkey can use his webbing to create web constructs, such as a web net.<ref name="MA">''[[Malgax Attacks]]''</ref> He can also create enough webbing to make a soft cushion to land on if falling.<ref name="TMoAV">''[[The Mother of All Vreedles]]''</ref>

Ultimate Spidermonkey is much stronger than his devolved form, being strong enough to overpower and take down a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]].<ref name="TUH">''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref>

Ultimate Spidermonkey is extremely durable, being able to survive [[Atomix|Atomix's]] Nuclear Winner<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref> and take a punch from a Tetramand.<ref name="TUH">''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref> Also, considering that he once fell through space and down to earth, Ultimate Spidermonkey is resistant to radiation and extreme heat, as he was completely unharmed after falling through the atmosphere.<ref name="TMoAV" />

Ultimate Spidermonkey is extremely agile, and he can jump extremely high.<ref name="FaFBM" /><ref name="TP">''[[The Purge]]''</ref> 

Ultimate Spidermonkey is capable of climbing walls, much like his devolved form.<ref name="MA" /> He also has prehensile feet.<ref name="TP" />

In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ultimate Spidermonkey's spider legs could pull things and break them almost as if he were using his hands. He could also fold his spider legs into his waist, and attack with the tips of the legs, as they were sharp enough to pierce a concrete wall.<ref name="TP" />

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
FaFBM (683).png|Dissolvable Webs
TUH (549).png|Sedative Quill Vulnerability
</gallery>
Ultimate Spidermonkey's webs can be torn apart by species as strong as [[Anodite]]s<ref name="TUS">''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref> or dissolved by the nuclear energy from members of [[Atomix's Species|Atomix's species]].<ref name="FaFBM" />

Ultimate Spidermonkey can be put to sleep by [[Argit]]'s quills.<ref name="TUH" />

Ultimate Spidermonkey's ears are vulnerable to [[Ultimate Sonorosian|Ultimate Sonorosians]]' sonic vibrations, as demonstrated by [[Sentient Ultimate Spidermonkey]].<ref>''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]'' </ref>

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*Ultimate Spidermonkey first appeared in ''[[Fame]]'', where he defeated [[Bivalvan]].
*In ''[[Reflected Glory]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey was defeated by [[Psyphon]] only to be saved by [[Cash Murray (Classic)|Cash]] and [[JT (Classic)|JT]]
*In ''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey battled and was defeated by [[Sunder]].
*In ''[[The Purge]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated [[Sir Driscoll]].
*In ''[[Simian Says]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated [[Mizaru]].
*In ''[[Double or Nothing]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated [[Hugh]]. Later, Ultimate Spidermonkey readied to battle [[Albedo]], but reverted to Ben when going through a force-field.
*In ''[[The Mother of All Vreedles]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey failed to defeat the [[Vreedle Brothers]], [[Ma Vreedle]], and [[Pretty Boy Vreedle]] in space due to the lack of oxygen and fell back to [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]].
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey was defeated by [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] in a dream.

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated [[Shocksquatch]] and battled [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] before being put to sleep by [[Argit]]'s quills.
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated Shocksquatch.
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey was defeated by [[Atomix]].
*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey chased after [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] only to be ambushed by [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as [[Wildvine (Classic)|Wildvine]].
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated three [[Galvan Security Officers]] and managed to break into [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s laboratory.

