==Games==
===Video Games===
====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
Ultimate Spidermonkey is a playable alien in the game.

Ultimate Spidermonkey is the most used [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] in the game, as he is used twice while the rest of the others are only used once.

Ultimate Spidermonkey can pound the ground to make small shockwaves and spin his spider legs around to damage enemies around him.

===Comics===
===Cartoon Network Action Pack!===
====Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Going Viral]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated the Dragon Monster.
*In ''[[Breaking News]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated some [[DNAlien]]s.
*In ''[[Remote Control]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey avoided [[Sir Driscoll]]'s lasers.
*In ''[[Christmas Clown]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated the [[Zombozo (Classic)|Zombozo]] animatronic.
*In ''[[Hero Times Two]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey, along with [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]], prevented the [[Pack]] from getting the Promethium.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Museum Mayhem]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey defeated [[Vulkanus]].

