==Trivia==
*Ultimate Spidermonkey was the first [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] to be used in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.
*In ''[[Reflected Glory]]'', Ultimate Spidermonkey's jaw kept splitting whenever he spoke; this did not happen in any of his other appearances.
*Ultimate Spidermonkey was the [[Alien of the Month]] in February 2011.
*Ultimate Spidermonkey is the only Ultimate form to have a complete redesign in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', as well as the only Ultimate form in that show to have a different voice actor from his regular form.
*In '''Omniverse''', Ultimate Spidermonkey cannot grow spider legs out from the spikes on his shoulders.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Echo Echo Can Duplicate in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Spidermonkey's '''Ultimate Alien''' appearance was designed by [[Glenn Wong]], with color styling by Chris Hooten.{{Refn|https://archive.is/qvdJQ|group = GW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] helped with designing Ultimate Spidermonkey's '''Omniverse''' appearance.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*If [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] had access to Ultimate Spidermonkey in '''Omniverse''', he would still have six arms similar to Negative Ultimate Spidermonkey.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ult. Spidermonkey Concept for Ben.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Spidermonkey was originally not supposed to appear in:
**''[[The Purge]]'', with his role taken by [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/7/71/The_Purge_Script_Outline.pdf ''The Purge'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**The dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'' with his role taken by [[Eatle]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}
*When Ultimate Spidermonkey shoots webs from his mouth in '''Omniverse''', his mouth bears resemblance to the [[Wikipedia:Predator (fictional species)|Predators]] from the franchise of the same name.
*Derrick thought Ultimate Spidermonkey's design was pretty cool, digging the big purple Grape Ape-esque gorilla vibe of his '''Ultimate Alien''' design. He also liked his '''Omniverse''' design even more due to him having eight full gorilla arms, and commended [[Paul Eiding]] for providing a really feral-sounding voice.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}

